{
 "format": "scry-knowledge/2",
 "dictionary": "vmisc",
 "title": "The VGA's general and CRT controller ports",
 "kind": "register",
 "scope": "vmisc",
 "covers": "The general registers of IBM's VGA and the CRT controller port blocks: the Miscellaneous Output register at hex 03C2 and 03CC with Input Status Register 0 read at hex 03C2, Input Status Register 1 at hex 03DA or 03BA, the Feature Control register at hex 03CA written at 03DA or 03BA, the palette write address at hex 03C8, and the CRT controller address and data ports in the hex 03Bx and 03Dx blocks, as IBM's Video Subsystems guide describes them, and what DOSBox-X does for each",
 "source": "official",
