     "lines": "2736-2744"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
     "lines": "2746-2760"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_misc.cpp",
     "lines": "104-158"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_misc.cpp",
     "lines": "161-165"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_misc.cpp",
     "lines": "182-197"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/vga_misc.cpp",
     "lines": "219"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The read address of the Miscellaneous Output register is hex 03CC and its write address is hex 03C2.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2696-2697",
       "sha": "312070cfb85a3c3c85d43667aaaa96fe29b8aa6338f51645f43dd094b9ac204c"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "bits 7-6",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "A write stores VSP in bit 7 and HSP in bit 6: 0 gives a positive sync polarity, and the pair gives 400, 350 or 480 lines, 00 reserved.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2708-2719",
       "sha": "39913007f4126694356fce6ac89482dbdba7e8e153672dffe0d0312f26bea110"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "bits 3-2",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "A write stores the Clock Select field in bits 3-2: 00 (printed o0) selects the 640/320 pel clock, 01 (o1) the 720/360 clock, 10 an external clock, 11 reserved.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2721-2732",
       "sha": "ece727eaa363a2777d6cbb94dd83bf7a9ca93eb872b8ec6bfb65372ca2ecf8f9"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "bit 1",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "When the Enable RAM field, bit 1, is 0, address decode for the display buffer from the system is disabled.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2734-2735",
       "sha": "d4f0c14861c3dbe8ed3c54bce661e3655cf9d66fbf85eec26090c73da2bd4e60"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "bit 0",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The I/O Address Select field, bit 0, sets the CRT controller and Input Status Register 1 to 03Bx and 03BA or 03Dx and 03DA, and moves the Feature Control writes.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2736-2744",
       "sha": "64420b42d7bf48e263f9bc1a343455dbd23366ee62923b2770f8649b617bd4e7"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Input Status Register 0 is the read-only register at address hex 03C2; the document says not to write to it.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2746-2747",
       "sha": "99ceabf7a5f9db72c03919a073b5fccf678cd2518406fdd2e8c46cdf93310387"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "bit 7",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In Input Status Register 0, a set CI, bit 7, says a vertical retrace interrupt is pending.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2756-2758",
       "sha": "2d5c78ab0f3a4743f2f7fee82fb90d48fd41c1c7a96c14148d5dbff1888ff156"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "bit 4",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "BIOS uses the Switch Sense field, bit 4, in determining the type of display attached.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
       "lines": "2759-2760",
       "sha": "2a5b279865795c21031d4a5c8490bbddc9eeead7bb9c1c40bd291ce87f54c22c"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "9",
     "on": "read",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The Miscellaneous Output register is read at hex 03CC.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:PS2-Video-Subsystems.raw.txt",
